{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EXO","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"出埃及記","commonName":"出埃及記","title":"出埃及記","order":2,"numberOfChapters":40,"sha256":"975f8d6f5a961502e0544f5845356bd86e40024b75e074eaca3a53bffa657137","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":40,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/40.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1212},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩西的歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那時，摩西和以色列人向耶和華唱歌說：",{"text":"我要向耶和華歌唱，因他大大戰勝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將馬和騎馬的投在海中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華是我的力量，我的詩歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也成了我的拯救。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是我的上帝，我要讚美他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我父親的上帝，我要尊崇他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華是戰士；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的名是耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"法老的車輛、軍兵，耶和華已拋在海中；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他特選的軍長都沉於紅海。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"深水淹沒他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們如同石頭墜到深處。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你的右手施展能力，顯出榮耀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你的右手摔碎仇敵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你大發威嚴，推翻那些起來攻擊你的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你發出烈怒如火，燒滅他們像燒碎稭一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你發鼻中的氣，水便聚起成堆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大水直立如壘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海中的深水凝結。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仇敵說：我要追趕，我要追上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要分擄物，我要在他們身上稱我的心願。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要拔出刀來，親手殺滅他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你叫風一吹，海就把他們淹沒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們如鉛沉在大水之中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，眾神之中，誰能像你？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能像你－至聖至榮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可頌可畏，施行奇事？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你伸出右手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地便吞滅他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"你憑慈愛領了你所贖的百姓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你憑能力引他們到了你的聖所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外邦人聽見就發顫；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"疼痛抓住非利士的居民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，以東的族長驚惶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押的英雄被戰兢抓住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦南的居民心都消化了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"驚駭恐懼臨到他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，因你膀臂的大能，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們如石頭寂然不動，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等候你的百姓過去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等候你所贖的百姓過去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要將他們領進去，栽於你產業的山上－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，就是你為自己所造的住處；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，就是你手所建立的聖所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必作王，直到永永遠遠！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"heading","content":["米利暗的歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["法老的馬匹、車輛，和馬兵下到海中，耶和華使海水回流，淹沒他們；惟有以色列人在海中走乾地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["亞倫的姊姊，女先知米利暗，手裏拿着鼓；眾婦女也跟她出去拿鼓跳舞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["米利暗應聲說：",{"text":"你們要歌頌耶和華，因他大大戰勝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將馬和騎馬的投在海中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["苦水"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["摩西領以色列人從紅海往前行，到了書珥的曠野，在曠野走了三天，找不着水。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["到了瑪拉，不能喝那裏的水；因為水苦，所以那地名叫瑪拉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["百姓就向摩西發怨言，說：「我們喝甚麼呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["摩西呼求耶和華，耶和華指示他一棵樹。他把樹丟在水裏，水就變甜了。 耶和華在那裏為他們定了律例、典章，在那裏試驗他們；"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["又說：「你若留意聽耶和華－你上帝的話，又行我眼中看為正的事，留心聽我的誡命，守我一切的律例，我就不將所加與埃及人的疾病加在你身上，因為我－耶和華是醫治你的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["他們到了以琳，在那裏有十二股水泉，七十棵棕樹；他們就在那裏的水邊安營。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":27}